@startuml
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #eef6ff
  BorderColor #2563eb
  FontColor #1e293b
}
skinparam defaultFontColor #1e293b
skinparam arrowColor #475569
skinparam shadowing false

title Plant Record Lifecycle - State Diagram

[*] --> Seed_Packet_Entered : Create plant record

Seed_Packet_Entered --> Indoor_Seedling : Record germination date

Indoor_Seedling --> Indoor_Growing : Seedling develops

Indoor_Growing --> Transplanted_Outdoor : Transplant event

Transplanted_Outdoor --> Flowering : First flowers observed

Flowering --> Fruiting : First fruit set

Fruiting --> Harvesting : First harvest

Harvesting --> Season_Complete : Final harvest

Season_Complete --> Dormant : End of season

Dormant --> Indoor_Seedling : New season
Dormant --> [*] : Plant end-of-life

note top of Seed_Packet_Entered
  Initial data entry from\nseed packet
end note

note bottom of Indoor_Growing
  Track: indoor temp,\nhumidity, fertilizer
end note

note bottom of Transplanted_Outdoor
  Record: new location,\noutdoor conditions
end note

note bottom of Flowering
  Track: conditions,\nwatering, weather
end note

note bottom of Harvesting
  Record: dates,\nquantity, quality
end note

note bottom of Season_Complete
  Record: total yield,\nseason learnings
end note

note bottom of Dormant
  Available actions at all states:\n- Log watering, fertilizer, humidity\n- Add notes and photos\n- Consult Hermes agent
end note
@enduml
